        },
        {
          "text": " Kosesen, ido koany, ebwoi ekabaka eiduny kepirike neelomarere, ka ikapolok ka arupepen eiduny ka ekabaka; kibwoŋasi ituŋa kere luka akwap, kokuta arupepen; koramata da ikayook iboro lueruosi, kiŋarenikinito ayoore naka aiturit. Kosodi Atalia aicil ikenapen, kobala ebe, “Ebotet, ebotet lokibilakinito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
