        },
        {
          "text": " Kitetemik Yekoiada aswam naka etogo loka EJAKAIT kakan naka isasedotin Ilebin, luabu Daudi kokorak togo loka EJAKAIT, ainakin ainakineta nuicweio nuka EJAKAIT, kwape ewadikatere okisila luka Musa, keibwoŋ ka ayoore, kwape ajaar aicorakinet naka Daudi, ",
